title: "INSURE-AI: National-Interest AI Modernization Methodology for Insurance Systems"
authors:
  - family-names: "Solan"
    given-names: "Rohin"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
date-released: 2026-09-25
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rohinjh/INSURE_AI_Applied_AI_Modernization_for_Insurance_Systems"
abstract: >
  INSURE-AI is a national-interest applied AI modernization methodology designed
  specifically for insurance systems. It defines a structured six-phase cycle—
  Identify, Normalize, Structure, Unify, Reinforce, Evaluate—covering enterprise
  data mining, regulated ML pipelines, Copilot collaboration, and Power Platform
  automation. This repository contains the full LaTeX technical report and TikZ
  diagrams for the INSURE-AI framework.
keywords:
